# Flowchart basics: labels, shapes, edge labels, direction and Markdown.
# Try editing a label, then click Format. Click a shape to find its source.
# Reference: https://d2lang.com/tour/shapes/
direction: down
request: Support request {shape: oval}
triage: Review the request
decision: Enough information? {shape: diamond}
clarify: Ask for details
resolve: Resolve the issue {style.border-radius: 12}
done: Customer notified {shape: oval}
request -> triage -> decision
decision -> clarify: No
clarify -> triage: Updated request {style.stroke-dash: 4}
decision -> resolve: Yes
resolve -> done
guide: |md
  **Try it**

  - Change the decision label
  - Switch direction to right
  - Export an SVG or PNG
|
